//! TEST-ONLY fakes and fixtures. Never compiled into a deployable build.
//!
//! Every key, seed and secret here is a published test value. The fixtures
//! are generated by this kit, not by the authority, and are never a
//! substitute for its official golden vectors. Conformance to those lives in
//! the crate's `tests::golden`; this kit stays for what the goldens cannot
//! exercise: fault injection, crash points, timing boundaries and scripted
//! authority behaviour.

